.TH PAUSE 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
pause \- wait for a signal
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <unistd.h>
.B int pause(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Suspends the calling thread until a signal terminates it or a handler returns.
There is a race if a signal arrives just before pause.
.SH RETURN VALUE
After a signal handler returns, returns \-1 with errno set to EINTR.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR alarm (3crunch),
.BR pause (2)
